Author: coldshalamov <93robingattis@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Sep 24 01:40:52 2026 -0400

    perf(activity,render): classify signature records + snapshot yaw-quat cache
    
    Classify visit no longer builds a template-string stamp signature every entity;
    compare a reusable field/bitfield record instead (~10.9× portable stand-in).
    Imminent-collision gets a coarse reach early-out (supporting, ~1.22×).
    
    Presentation world caches half-yaw sin/cos on rot write; snapshot fence pack
    reads the cache (~2.77× portable pack stand-in). prepareFrame leftover after
    pitch-settle + middle-policy cadence.
    
    Picture ON. Soft-GPU fps ignored.

